# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Jalsa credentials. Copy to apps/jalsa/.env (gitignored — the ONLY place
# credentials are read from). A pin-only sign-in: the PIN is the identity.
#
# The seeded PIN (1234) is PROVISIONAL and only opens "choose your own PIN".
# Choose a PIN once by hand in a normal browser, then put THAT PIN here.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- owner: the owner console (/owner) — read-only ------------------------------
OWNER_PIN=

# --- captain (optional): a captain's handset (/staff) --------------------------
# CAPTAIN_PIN=

# --- Values flows may use ------------------------------------------------------
# A table from the seed for the guest surface, e.g. A5 (used as /t/{{GUEST_TABLE}}).
# GUEST_TABLE=A5

# --- Optional overrides ----------------------------------------------------------
# A deployed preview instead of http://localhost:3000 — add its host to allowedHosts.
# APP_URL=
# Local clone of github.com/UniqBrio/JalsaRestaurant (the REPO root, not jalsa/).
# Used by the capture skip filter AND by `npm run coverage`. Forward slashes, no quotes.
# APP_REPO_PATH=
